{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01359",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 6.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.86,
      "end_seconds": 13.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.76,
      "end_seconds": 22.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Mainly more breathless than usual. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.87,
      "end_seconds": 25.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.46,
      "end_seconds": 29.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Yeah, for three weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.35,
      "end_seconds": 40.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.65,
      "end_seconds": 57.49,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "text": "Yes, walking. That makes it worse. I'd call it moderate. Oh, and a wheeze. That's been about the same, two days. With wheeze, it happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.49,
      "end_seconds": 78.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.93,
      "end_seconds": 89.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.64,
      "end_seconds": 111.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.2 degrees, pressure 137 over 79, pulse 87, respiratory rate 24, SpO2 90 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.86,
      "end_seconds": 113.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.34,
      "end_seconds": 116.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.14,
      "end_seconds": 122.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.85,
      "end_seconds": 125.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.42,
      "end_seconds": 150.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "There is wheeze at both bases and your oxygen is a little low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.8,
      "end_seconds": 155.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.84,
      "end_seconds": 173.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Have you had any coughing up blood, chest pain or swollen ankles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.41,
      "end_seconds": 178.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.29,
      "end_seconds": 182.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.61,
      "end_seconds": 184.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.2,
      "end_seconds": 188.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.39,
      "end_seconds": 191.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.42,
      "end_seconds": 210.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.15,
      "end_seconds": 216.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.12,
      "end_seconds": 222.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.94,
      "end_seconds": 225.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.62,
      "end_seconds": 228.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.24,
      "end_seconds": 239.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.78,
      "end_seconds": 245.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.22,
      "end_seconds": 253.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.9,
      "end_seconds": 258.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.66,
      "end_seconds": 263.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'm allergic to milk, I get stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.15,
      "end_seconds": 272.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.98,
      "end_seconds": 277.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I'm on Tiotropium inhaler, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.89,
      "end_seconds": 281.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "So, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.77,
      "end_seconds": 286.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I have COPD, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.25,
      "end_seconds": 293.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? This is probably a flare-up of COPD."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.05,
      "end_seconds": 333.95,
      "duration_seconds": 21.9,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a chest X-ray because of COPD flare. I'm prescribing prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, five days. That should help with COPD flare. Use your inhaler regularly and get seen if you are not better in three days. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.23,
      "end_seconds": 341.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.19,
      "end_seconds": 344.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "So, have a good day."
    }
  ]
}